The problem statement notes that the agent is currently configured to &quot;let the model decide when to call the tools&quot; (which is what tool_choice: &quot;auto&quot; does). However, the compliance requirement mandates:
​&quot;Each workflow run must include a retrieval step before generating a response.&quot;
If left as auto, the model might choose to answer directly from parametric memory without executing a tool call. Setting tool_choice: &quot;required&quot; forces the model to call one of its available tools before generating an answer.

